-- One-off backfill of mcp_usage for 2026-10-11 .. 2026-11-09, before the counter existed.
-- Source: Cloudflare HTTP analytics for api.inamprotocol.org/mcp (httpRequestsAdaptiveGroups),
-- 202 responses per UTC day and client family. A 2025-era client sends one
-- notifications/initialized per session and gets 202, so this estimates sessions (connects).
-- Stored as metric 'connect_est' so it stays distinguishable from counted rows. Idempotent.
-- Adaptive analytics are sampled, so counts are estimates. Tool calls are not recoverable.
